# 🏢 Smart Apartment Management System — Architecture Document

> **Agent**: Architect  
> **Stack**: React + Tailwind · Node.js + Express · PostgreSQL · Razorpay  
> **Date**: 2026-03-18

---

## 1. Database Schema

### 1.1 Entity-Relationship Overview

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USERS          ||--o{ UNITS            : "owns/rents"
    UNITS          }o--|| BUILDINGS         : "belongs to"
    BUILDINGS      }o--|| COMPLEXES         : "part of"
    USERS          ||--o{ VISITOR_PASSES    : "creates"
    VISITOR_PASSES ||--o| QR_CODES          : "has"
    USERS          ||--o{ PAYMENTS          : "makes"
    PAYMENTS       ||--o| RAZORPAY_TXN      : "linked to"
    UNITS          ||--o{ PARKING_SLOTS     : "assigned"
    USERS          ||--o{ VENDOR_REQUESTS   : "raises"
    VENDOR_REQUESTS}o--|| VENDORS           : "fulfilled by"
    USERS          ||--o{ EMERGENCY_ALERTS  : "triggers"
    USERS          ||--o{ AUDIT_LOG         : "generates"
```

