### 1.2 Table Definitions

#### Core / Identity

| Table | Column | Type | Constraints | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **complexes** | id | UUID | PK | Top-level entity |
| | name | VARCHAR(120) | NOT NULL | |
| | address | TEXT | | |
| | created_at / updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | DEFAULT now() | |
| **buildings** | id | UUID | PK | |
| | complex_id | UUID | FK → complexes | |
| | name | VARCHAR(60) | NOT NULL | e.g. "Block A" |
| | total_floors | SMALLINT | | |
| **units** | id | UUID | PK | |
| | building_id | UUID | FK → buildings | |
| | unit_number | VARCHAR(20) | NOT NULL | e.g. "A-301" |
| | floor | SMALLINT | | |
| | type | ENUM('1BHK','2BHK','3BHK','penthouse','studio') | | |
| | status | ENUM('occupied','vacant','maintenance') | DEFAULT 'vacant' | |
| **users** | id | UUID | PK | |
| | email | VARCHAR(255) | UNIQUE, NOT NULL | Login credential |
| | phone | VARCHAR(15) | UNIQUE | |
| | password_hash | TEXT | NOT NULL | bcrypt |
| | full_name | VARCHAR(120) | | |
| | role | ENUM('super_admin','admin','resident','tenant','security','vendor') | NOT NULL | RBAC |
| | avatar_url | TEXT | | |
| | is_active | BOOLEAN | DEFAULT true | Soft disable |
| | created_at / updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | | |
| **user_units** | user_id | UUID | FK → users, PK | Many-to-many join |
| | unit_id | UUID | FK → units, PK | |
| | relation | ENUM('owner','tenant','family') | | |
| | moved_in_at | DATE | | |
| | moved_out_at | DATE | NULL | |

#### Visitor & QR Module

| Table | Column | Type | Constraints | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **visitor_passes** | id | UUID | PK | |
| | host_user_id | UUID | FK → users | Resident who invited |
| | visitor_name | VARCHAR(120) | NOT NULL | |
| | visitor_phone | VARCHAR(15) | | |
| | purpose | ENUM('guest','delivery','cab','service','other') | | |
| | valid_from | TIMESTAMPTZ | NOT NULL | |
| | valid_until | TIMESTAMPTZ | NOT NULL | Expiry window |
| | status | ENUM('pending','approved','checked_in','checked_out','expired','cancelled') | DEFAULT 'pending' | |
| | checked_in_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | | |
| | checked_out_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | | |
| | approved_by | UUID | FK → users, NULL | Security/admin override |
| **qr_codes** | id | UUID | PK | |
| | visitor_pass_id | UUID | FK → visitor_passes, UNIQUE | 1:1 |
| | token | VARCHAR(64) | UNIQUE, NOT NULL | HMAC-signed token |
| | scanned_count | INT | DEFAULT 0 | Prevent replay |
| | max_scans | SMALLINT | DEFAULT 1 | |
| | expires_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | NOT NULL | Independent QR expiry |

#### Payments Module

| Table | Column | Type | Constraints | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **invoices** | id | UUID | PK | |
| | unit_id | UUID | FK → units | |
| | type | ENUM('maintenance','rent','water','electricity','clubhouse','penalty','other') | | |
| | amount | NUMERIC(12,2) | NOT NULL | |
| | due_date | DATE | NOT NULL | |
| | status | ENUM('draft','sent','paid','overdue','partially_paid','waived') | DEFAULT 'draft' | |
| | created_by | UUID | FK → users | Admin who generated |
| | period_start / period_end | DATE | | Billing period |
| **payments** | id | UUID | PK | |
| | invoice_id | UUID | FK → invoices | |
| | user_id | UUID | FK → users | Who paid |
| | amount | NUMERIC(12,2) | NOT NULL | Supports partial pay |
| | method | ENUM('razorpay','cash','cheque','bank_transfer','wallet') | | |
| | status | ENUM('initiated','authorized','captured','failed','refunded') | | Mirrors Razorpay states |
| | paid_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | | |
| **razorpay_txns** | id | UUID | PK | |
| | payment_id | UUID | FK → payments | |
| | rz_order_id | VARCHAR(40) | NOT NULL | Razorpay order ID |
| | rz_payment_id | VARCHAR(40) | | Filled on capture |
| | rz_signature | TEXT | | For verification |
| | raw_webhook | JSONB | | Full webhook payload |
| | event | VARCHAR(60) | | e.g. `payment.captured` |
| | created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | | |

