## 2. API Structure

> **Base URL**: `/api/v1`  
> **Auth**: Bearer JWT on all routes except `POST /auth/*`  
> **Pagination**: `?page=1&limit=20` / cursor-based for feeds  
> **Rate Limit**: 100 req/min per user; 10 req/min on auth endpoints

### 2.1 Authentication

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/auth/register` | Register resident/tenant (invite-only token) | Public |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Email + password → JWT pair | Public |
| POST | `/auth/refresh` | Refresh access token | Any |
| POST | `/auth/forgot-password` | Send OTP / reset link | Public |
| POST | `/auth/reset-password` | Set new password with token | Public |
| GET | `/auth/me` | Current user profile | Any |
| PATCH | `/auth/me` | Update profile | Any |
| POST | `/auth/change-password` | Authenticated password change | Any |

### 2.2 Users & Units (Admin)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/admin/users` | List all users (filter by role, building) | admin+ |
| GET | `/admin/users/:id` | User detail | admin+ |
| PATCH | `/admin/users/:id` | Update role / deactivate | admin+ |
| POST | `/admin/units` | Create unit | admin+ |
| GET | `/admin/units` | List units with occupancy | admin+ |
| PATCH | `/admin/units/:id` | Update unit status | admin+ |
| POST | `/admin/units/:id/assign` | Assign user to unit | admin+ |

### 2.3 Visitor & QR System

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/visitors` | Create visitor pass + auto-generate QR | resident+ |
| GET | `/visitors` | List my visitor passes | resident+ |
| GET | `/visitors/:id` | Pass detail + QR code data | resident+ |
| PATCH | `/visitors/:id/cancel` | Cancel a pending pass | resident+ |
| POST | `/visitors/verify-qr` | Security scans QR → validate + check-in | security+ |
| PATCH | `/visitors/:id/checkout` | Mark visitor checked out | security+ |
| GET | `/admin/visitors` | All visitor logs (filter by date, building) | admin+ |
| POST | `/visitors/pre-approve` | Bulk pre-approve (e.g. party) | resident+ |

### 2.4 Payments

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/invoices` | My invoices (filter by status, type) | resident+ |
| GET | `/invoices/:id` | Invoice detail | resident+ |
| POST | `/admin/invoices` | Generate invoices (single / bulk) | admin+ |
| POST | `/admin/invoices/bulk` | Auto-generate monthly maintenance | admin+ |
| PATCH | `/admin/invoices/:id` | Waive / adjust amount | admin+ |
| POST | `/payments/create-order` | Create Razorpay order for invoice | resident+ |
| POST | `/payments/verify` | Verify Razorpay signature + capture | resident+ |
| POST | `/payments/webhook` | Razorpay webhook receiver (no auth, HMAC) | Razorpay |
| GET | `/payments` | My payment history | resident+ |
| GET | `/admin/payments` | All payments + analytics | admin+ |
| GET | `/admin/payments/report` | Exportable report (CSV/PDF) | admin+ |

### 2.5 Parking

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/parking/slots` | Available slots (filter by type, building) | resident+ |
| GET | `/parking/my-slots` | My assigned slots | resident+ |
| POST | `/admin/parking/slots` | Create / bulk-import slots | admin+ |
| POST | `/admin/parking/assign` | Assign slot to unit | admin+ |
| DELETE | `/admin/parking/assign/:id` | Release assignment | admin+ |
| PATCH | `/admin/parking/slots/:id` | Change slot status | admin+ |

### 2.6 Vendor Services

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/vendors` | List verified vendors (filter by category) | resident+ |
