| GET | `/vendor-requests` | My requests | resident+ |
| GET | `/vendor-requests/:id` | Request detail | resident+ |
| PATCH | `/vendor-requests/:id/cancel` | Cancel open request | resident+ |
| PATCH | `/vendor-requests/:id/rate` | Rate completed service | resident+ |
| PATCH | `/admin/vendor-requests/:id/assign` | Assign vendor | admin+ |
| PATCH | `/admin/vendor-requests/:id/status` | Update status | admin+ |
| POST | `/admin/vendors` | Add vendor | admin+ |
| PATCH | `/admin/vendors/:id` | Update / verify vendor | admin+ |

